  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Credit Program Production Development and Employment in San Juan Province</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Crdito Desarrollo Produccin y Empleo Provincia San Juan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general (fin) del Programa es apoyar el desarrollo de la economa de la Provincia de San Juan. El objetivo especfico (propsito) es fortalecer la competitividad de las Pequeas y Medianas Empresas de la Provincia en los mercados nacionales y extranjeros, a travs del mejoramiento del acceso al financiamiento y al desarrollo empresarial en un mbito publico-privado fortalecido.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective (goal) of the Program is to support the economic development of the Province of San Juan. The specific objective (purpose) is to strengthen the competitiveness of the Small and Medium Enterprises of the Province in local and foreign markets by improving the access to financing and by promoting the development of the industry with a strong public-private relation.</narrative>
  </description>
